WEBVTT

01:49.470 --> 01:54.970
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:58.020
[Episode 6]

02:01.950 --> 02:04.010
Chu Guihong was invited by Song Yude?

02:04.120 --> 02:04.920
Yes.

02:05.070 --> 02:06.870
They had a long talk in the study.

02:07.560 --> 02:09.020
Seems like the Song family

02:09.430 --> 02:12.030
is getting engaged
in the fight for the throne.

02:12.360 --> 02:15.090
If we don't get rid
of this wild card—Song Yimeng,

02:15.190 --> 02:16.680
she'll be a looming threat.

02:16.680 --> 02:17.540
Your Highness,

02:17.620 --> 02:19.190
that cunning Song Yimeng

02:19.190 --> 02:20.680
has got you at her mercy...

02:20.680 --> 02:21.310
So...

02:21.960 --> 02:23.240
Yes, I can't kill her,

02:24.079 --> 02:25.070
but it doesn't mean

02:25.070 --> 02:26.730
I've got nothing up my sleeve.

02:28.360 --> 02:30.090
Tell the Waning River Crescent that

02:30.090 --> 02:32.370
it's time for them to prove their value.

02:33.340 --> 02:36.590
[Laiyi House]

02:38.920 --> 02:40.690
Scriptwriter,

02:41.470 --> 02:44.470
where on earth can I find
the method of weapon forging?

02:44.660 --> 02:47.090
Any clues, please?

02:48.960 --> 02:51.310
You can't fool me like this.

02:54.120 --> 02:54.990
My Lady!

02:55.240 --> 02:56.230
My Lady!

02:56.360 --> 02:57.240
-My Lady!
-My Lady!

02:57.240 --> 02:58.150
Wake up, My Lady!

02:58.150 --> 02:58.560
My Lady!

02:58.560 --> 02:59.400
My Lady, what's wrong?

02:59.400 --> 02:59.800
My Lady.

02:59.800 --> 03:01.130
Don't scare me, My Lady.

03:01.280 --> 03:02.790
Stop shaking me.

03:03.190 --> 03:05.520
I'm really going to die
if you keep this up.

03:05.740 --> 03:07.340
That really gave me a fright.

03:07.430 --> 03:08.190
My Lady, why are you

03:08.190 --> 03:09.560
torturing yourself like this?

03:09.560 --> 03:11.160
The Seventh Prince has left.

03:11.680 --> 03:13.240
What's wrong, My Lady?

03:13.240 --> 03:15.520
What if you hurt yourself?

03:15.520 --> 03:18.320
General Chu just told you
to take care of yourself.

03:18.360 --> 03:20.960
He will be heartbroken
to see you in this state.

03:26.060 --> 03:27.240
You're right.

03:28.710 --> 03:30.240
My vision of a carefree life

03:30.329 --> 03:31.360
can't be ended here

03:31.360 --> 03:33.000
by that Nan Heng!

03:33.470 --> 03:34.280
Yingqiu,

03:34.310 --> 03:35.310
Go sort out

03:35.310 --> 03:36.440
my private savings.

03:37.400 --> 03:38.310
Just you wait.

03:39.190 --> 03:40.520
I am going all out

03:40.930 --> 03:42.560
by spending big bucks.

03:42.650 --> 03:49.130
[Blacksmith]

03:42.800 --> 03:44.150
Big bucks? Forget about it.

03:44.150 --> 03:45.000
Go away.

03:45.310 --> 03:46.120
Sir,

03:46.190 --> 03:47.680
please do us a favor.

03:47.700 --> 03:49.360
I can pay you more if possible.

03:49.840 --> 03:50.680
I'm rich.

03:50.750 --> 03:51.800
Like, super rich.

03:51.910 --> 03:53.360
It's not about money.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.120
Miss,

03:54.140 --> 03:55.190
in the Great Jing Dynasty,

03:55.190 --> 03:56.240
steel forging is prohibited

03:56.240 --> 03:58.079
except within the Qianyu Army.

03:58.190 --> 03:58.840
Besides,

03:58.840 --> 04:00.400
we can't make it. Really.

04:00.400 --> 04:01.520
Please spare us.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.190
Sir,

04:03.340 --> 04:06.610
[Blacksmith]

04:03.430 --> 04:05.030
you should at least give it a try.

04:05.030 --> 04:05.800
I can raise my budget.

04:05.800 --> 04:07.260
I really can't do it, Miss.

04:10.400 --> 04:13.310
The method of weapon forging
is a key plot.

04:13.360 --> 04:14.870
Why didn't the scriptwriter

04:14.870 --> 04:16.000
leave me any clues?

04:17.680 --> 04:19.220
If I still can't find it,

04:19.360 --> 04:21.290
Nan Heng will melt me down for sure.

04:22.750 --> 04:23.750
Yingqiu, let's go

04:23.800 --> 04:24.750
to the next one.

04:24.830 --> 04:25.630
My Lady,

04:25.920 --> 04:29.380
we've finished visiting
all the blacksmiths across the city.

04:30.720 --> 04:31.750
Didn't expect it

04:31.870 --> 04:33.600
to be so tough to forge an iron sword

04:33.600 --> 04:34.720
into a steel one.

04:35.430 --> 04:36.920
Other than Lord Qianyu and Chu Guihong,

04:36.920 --> 04:38.750
no one else knows this technique?

04:38.750 --> 04:40.600
They really keep the core technology

04:40.600 --> 04:42.130
absolutely confidential.

04:42.620 --> 04:43.950
Go away.

04:43.970 --> 04:45.720
How dare you sell the stolen good to me?

04:44.030 --> 04:45.240
[Cuijin]

04:45.750 --> 04:47.360
I'll report it to the officials!

04:47.360 --> 04:48.310
Listen,

04:48.480 --> 04:50.510
if I take it to the Waning River Crescent,

04:50.510 --> 04:52.310
it will sell at a good price for sure.

04:52.310 --> 04:53.120
Bah!

04:53.159 --> 04:53.950
Go away.

04:54.750 --> 04:56.080
Waning River Crescent?

04:56.920 --> 04:57.870
Sir.

04:57.890 --> 04:58.830
Excuse me.

04:58.830 --> 05:01.290
Is the Waning River Crescent
a black market?

05:01.560 --> 05:02.480
Yes, so what?

05:02.600 --> 05:04.330
What does it have to do with you?

05:06.010 --> 05:07.040
Yes!

05:07.920 --> 05:11.280
What a windfall!

05:21.270 --> 05:22.830
Tell Mr. Shangguan—

05:22.850 --> 05:24.030
the task is complete,

05:24.030 --> 05:26.160
and the little fish has taken the bait.

05:29.720 --> 05:30.600
Come on.

05:30.830 --> 05:32.290
Please spare me some food.

05:33.120 --> 05:35.270
I haven't had anything to eat for days.

05:35.270 --> 05:36.159
Screw you!

05:36.950 --> 05:38.270
Stinky beggar!

05:38.950 --> 05:39.680
Miss!

05:39.680 --> 05:41.240
You look gorgeous, Miss.

05:41.360 --> 05:42.240
You ruined the mood!

05:42.240 --> 05:42.830
Don't grope.

05:42.830 --> 05:44.120
Miss, Miss.

05:44.170 --> 05:45.750
Please give me some food.

05:45.750 --> 05:46.510
Miss.

05:46.510 --> 05:47.920
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

05:47.920 --> 05:48.680
My Lady,

05:48.750 --> 05:50.430
this place isn't meant for us.

05:50.510 --> 05:51.480
How about we go back and ask

05:51.480 --> 05:53.600
the Master
to send someone here tomorrow?

05:53.600 --> 05:54.390
No way!

05:54.710 --> 05:56.830
Nan Heng gave me two days in total.

05:56.850 --> 05:59.120
I must figure out a way tonight.

05:59.140 --> 06:00.230
Follow me.

06:04.120 --> 06:04.920
General,

06:04.920 --> 06:06.190
we've checked it out.

06:06.260 --> 06:08.480
The Nightwalkers are huge in number.

06:08.640 --> 06:10.320
Their leader, Li Shiliu,

06:10.430 --> 06:12.640
is said to be a ruthless kung-fu master.

06:12.880 --> 06:14.400
Can we really pull it off

06:14.510 --> 06:15.770
with these few people?

06:16.000 --> 06:16.800
Don't worry.

06:17.040 --> 06:18.850
100 elite soldiers will sneak in groups.

06:18.850 --> 06:20.020
Stay alert tonight.

06:20.050 --> 06:21.910
Don't give away your identities.

06:22.270 --> 06:23.070
Yes.

06:35.070 --> 06:35.810
Bro.

06:36.040 --> 06:36.720
Bro!

06:37.680 --> 06:38.930
Excuse me,

06:39.320 --> 06:42.380
do you know the way
to the Waning River Crescent's Hall?

06:43.600 --> 06:47.600
[Po Yunlong, the Third Master
of the Waning River Crescent]

06:52.570 --> 06:53.850
Three taels of gold.

06:53.880 --> 06:55.260
Here you are.

06:56.450 --> 06:57.720
Thank you, bro.

06:59.440 --> 07:00.700
Please get on the boat.

07:01.950 --> 07:02.750
Let's go.

08:14.640 --> 08:17.050
[Secret Report—Junior General Chu Guihong
of Qianyu Army has led]

08:17.050 --> 08:19.460
[dozens of Qianyu soldiers, attempting
to sneak into the hall in disguise.]

08:34.929 --> 08:38.690
[Shangguan He, the Second Master
of the Waning River Crescent]

08:35.500 --> 08:37.490
Isn't it just to kill a woman?

08:37.510 --> 08:39.510
Why did you bother coming in person?

08:43.840 --> 08:45.300
You go deal with Lady Song.

08:46.010 --> 08:48.140
An important guest will come tonight.

08:48.510 --> 08:49.840
I'm on another mission.

08:50.390 --> 08:51.640
Any new information?

08:51.790 --> 08:53.200
Do you need help?

08:53.630 --> 08:54.440
No, thanks.

08:54.870 --> 08:57.320
The hall is awash with big shots today.

08:57.320 --> 08:58.550
Can't make a scene.

08:58.550 --> 08:59.750
I can handle it alone.

09:00.870 --> 09:02.870
You've got everything ready for it?

09:03.910 --> 09:05.960
There's no way a weak woman

09:06.030 --> 09:07.270
can escape.

09:07.630 --> 09:08.440
However,

09:08.790 --> 09:11.510
we, Waning River Crescent, never kill
the old, the weak, women, or children.

09:11.510 --> 09:12.710
How come this time...

09:13.440 --> 09:16.160
Don't underestimate this woman.

09:16.260 --> 09:17.320
It's an exception.

09:19.790 --> 09:20.600
Exception?

09:21.750 --> 09:22.480
Don't forget...

09:22.480 --> 09:23.570
I know.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.870
her background is special
as the daughter of a big shot.

09:25.870 --> 09:27.070
Do it outside the hall

09:27.110 --> 09:28.370
and leave no evidence.

09:33.080 --> 09:34.210
What a pity.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.540
The beauty's life

09:36.630 --> 09:39.670
is going to end here tonight.

09:59.600 --> 10:00.390
Come on.

10:04.740 --> 10:05.950
How fancy.

10:06.170 --> 10:07.570
This is a big production.

10:14.270 --> 10:15.390
The setting...

10:15.810 --> 10:17.740
This production crew must be rich.

10:18.260 --> 10:19.570
Let's go take a look.

10:21.960 --> 10:23.440
If I had known there was

10:23.440 --> 10:25.330
such an amazing place in this script,

10:25.330 --> 10:27.080
I wouldn't have stayed
in the Song Mansion only

10:27.080 --> 10:29.080
to fight against Nan Heng!

10:29.220 --> 10:30.260
This way, please.

10:33.630 --> 10:34.850
Big, big, big.

10:34.410 --> 10:35.410
[Big Fortune]

10:34.870 --> 10:35.840
Big, big, big.

10:36.040 --> 10:37.480
Yingqiu, let's go in

10:37.550 --> 10:38.510
and take a look.

10:38.510 --> 10:39.770
Big, big, big.

10:39.790 --> 10:40.840
Big, big, big.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.240
Six!

10:42.750 --> 10:43.630
Yingqiu,

10:43.670 --> 10:44.730
give me the wallet.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.080
My Lady, don't join them.

10:46.080 --> 10:47.000
Don't worry.

10:47.000 --> 10:48.750
Give it to me.

10:49.140 --> 10:50.000
This is the last bet.

10:50.000 --> 10:51.180
The last bet!

10:52.520 --> 10:54.010
What's wrong with you?

10:54.190 --> 10:58.080
[Duan Shanhu, the Fourth Master
of the Waning River Crescent]

10:56.510 --> 10:58.480
Miss, you actually placed a bet
on the Leopard!

10:58.480 --> 10:59.840
How courageous!

10:59.840 --> 11:01.270
Impressive!

11:02.150 --> 11:03.370
H-Hold on.

11:03.390 --> 11:04.700
Excuse me.

11:04.870 --> 11:06.540
Does this Leopard mean

11:06.560 --> 11:08.420
all three dices

11:08.600 --> 11:10.240
revealing the same number?

11:09.480 --> 11:09.790
[Leopard]

11:10.320 --> 11:11.120
Yes.

11:11.670 --> 11:12.590
That means

11:12.630 --> 11:14.750
this can't be the Leopard no matter what,

11:14.750 --> 11:15.360
right?

11:15.550 --> 11:16.360
Smart.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.090
That doesn't count!

11:18.090 --> 11:19.510
That man bumped into me just now,

11:19.510 --> 11:21.000
so I threw the wallet over here.

11:21.000 --> 11:21.750
I need to do it again.

11:21.750 --> 11:22.530
Miss,

11:22.840 --> 11:24.030
the gambling rules—

11:24.030 --> 11:25.760
no changes to the bet you place.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.480
Bro,

11:29.630 --> 11:31.030
the rules are rigid,

11:31.030 --> 11:32.270
but people should be flexible.

11:32.270 --> 11:33.510
If the rules are flexible,

11:33.510 --> 11:34.930
people will be dead.

11:35.020 --> 11:35.980
But...

11:44.140 --> 11:45.720
Why?

11:45.840 --> 11:47.630
I went through all the trouble
by world-hopping

11:47.630 --> 11:49.010
to get this money!

11:49.320 --> 11:50.120
I already lost

11:50.120 --> 11:51.720
before I got a chance to play!

11:51.960 --> 11:52.750
No way.

11:53.390 --> 11:54.390
I won't accept it.

11:55.690 --> 11:57.120
I won't accept it!

12:35.240 --> 12:36.290
Forget it.

12:36.450 --> 12:38.020
I'm not Chingmy Yau.

12:38.380 --> 12:39.360
Whatever.

12:39.750 --> 12:40.900
No more daydreams.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.150
Leopard.

12:42.200 --> 12:42.790
It's the Leopard!

12:42.790 --> 12:43.910
They were one and six just now!

12:43.910 --> 12:45.670
T-This is impossible.

12:45.670 --> 12:46.320
No way

12:46.320 --> 12:47.480
it turned into the Leopard!

12:47.480 --> 12:48.340
What happened?

12:50.060 --> 12:50.680
[Six]

12:50.600 --> 12:51.440
Three sixes?

12:50.770 --> 12:51.460
[Leopard]

12:53.100 --> 12:54.500
Did I see it right?

12:56.190 --> 12:58.790
Is it the manifestation
of the God of Gambling?

12:59.190 --> 13:01.050
So I'm not Chingmy Yau,

13:01.240 --> 13:02.900
but Chow Yun-fat!

13:03.720 --> 13:04.440
Everyone,

13:04.440 --> 13:05.200
thank you.

13:05.200 --> 13:06.510
Thank you.

13:06.510 --> 13:06.870
Yingqiu,

13:06.870 --> 13:07.820
Hurry up.

13:07.840 --> 13:09.060
Hurry.

13:09.080 --> 13:09.670
Come on.

13:12.210 --> 13:13.750
Who cheated?

13:16.960 --> 13:17.620
[Clear Clouds & Autumn Moon]

13:21.260 --> 13:22.150
Whatever.

13:28.110 --> 13:29.350
Interesting.

13:30.270 --> 13:31.200
Pass on my words.

13:31.750 --> 13:33.120
I'll do it in person.

13:33.230 --> 13:34.250
You,

13:34.840 --> 13:35.720
playboy.

13:37.760 --> 13:39.100
Yunlong,

13:40.000 --> 13:41.510
you know me well.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.390
I will

13:43.870 --> 13:44.670
kill her.

13:45.860 --> 13:47.950
Killing a beauty is an art.

13:48.020 --> 13:51.620
Killing the beauty the client
cares about is an even greater one.

13:52.890 --> 13:54.430
Let me see

13:54.790 --> 13:55.720
why he said

13:56.320 --> 13:58.550
we couldn't underestimate this woman.

14:04.750 --> 14:05.550
Remember

14:05.590 --> 14:07.390
to keep it low-profile tonight.

14:07.780 --> 14:09.780
Investigate the defense in the hall

14:09.820 --> 14:12.410
and find out what they are up to.

14:12.440 --> 14:13.750
Don't act rashly.

14:15.200 --> 14:16.490
Don't worry, General.

14:16.750 --> 14:18.170
We've been idle for a while,

14:18.170 --> 14:19.970
planning to earn merit tonight.

14:36.250 --> 14:38.150
Phantom dragon lurks in the black market.

14:38.150 --> 14:40.880
Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers.

14:42.490 --> 14:45.690
♪ Phantom dragon
lurks in the black market ♪

14:47.700 --> 14:50.320
[Li Shiliu, Chief Master
of the Waning River Crescent]

14:47.730 --> 14:50.550
♪ Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers ♪

14:52.630 --> 14:54.520
♪ I ride on the wind
of the waning river crescent ♪

14:55.200 --> 14:57.180
♪ Hate the injustice in the world ♪

14:57.700 --> 14:59.730
♪ Loyalty and righteousness
weigh on both sides of the scale ♪

15:00.410 --> 15:02.700
♪ Wield the knife
to carve a rift in the hell ♪

15:03.270 --> 15:04.140
♪ The waning river crescent sheds light
over the old chess board ♪

15:04.380 --> 15:05.450
♪ On the 32 sandalwood tables ♪

15:05.760 --> 15:06.810
♪ The gamblers toss their bucks ♪

15:07.040 --> 15:08.070
♪ Beneath the dice cup
hide secret letters ♪

15:08.360 --> 15:09.390
♪ The storyteller unfolds the story ♪

15:09.750 --> 15:10.670
♪ The code is in the 13th line ♪

15:11.040 --> 15:12.080
♪ I dip cold tea to write spy info ♪

15:12.370 --> 15:13.370
♪ The ink seeps into the board ♪

15:14.770 --> 15:16.130
Impressive kung fu.

15:16.150 --> 15:17.710
So you're Li Shiliu?

15:17.770 --> 15:20.570
You don't need to know that
since you're gonna die.

15:24.440 --> 15:25.540
My Lady,

15:25.620 --> 15:27.170
where are we going now?

15:29.120 --> 15:30.490
We've earned enough money.

15:30.490 --> 15:32.090
Time to get down to business.

15:32.200 --> 15:33.000
Let's go

15:33.020 --> 15:34.930
to find the method of weapon forging.

15:34.930 --> 15:35.910
The method of weapon forging?

15:35.910 --> 15:36.790
Let's go.

15:38.750 --> 15:41.910
Nice! Bravo!

15:45.510 --> 15:46.510
What...

15:46.510 --> 15:47.670
What's going on?

15:47.670 --> 15:48.480
Everyone!

15:49.510 --> 15:52.670
Today, we're gathering
in the Waning River Crescent.

15:52.790 --> 15:53.790
Is there going to be a show?

15:53.790 --> 15:55.080
I secretly brought something

15:55.080 --> 15:56.360
interesting from the border.

15:56.360 --> 15:56.960
No rush to leave.

15:56.960 --> 15:57.960
Let's take a look.

15:58.150 --> 15:59.630
A top-grade good.

15:59.910 --> 16:02.110
I'm sure you've never seen this before.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.640
The bidding starts at 100 taels of gold!

16:05.150 --> 16:06.550
Is anyone interested?

16:06.790 --> 16:07.840
Stop bragging.

16:07.950 --> 16:10.120
I've been in the capital for years.

16:10.360 --> 16:11.790
Nothing can surprise me anymore!

16:11.790 --> 16:12.120
Yeah.

16:12.120 --> 16:14.670
This one is different.

16:15.720 --> 16:17.320
It's worth 100 taels of gold.

16:18.120 --> 16:18.790
Come on, take a look.

16:18.790 --> 16:20.000
What is it? Let me see.

16:28.290 --> 16:31.990
[Liu Jiao'er, Northern Dumb Girl]

16:29.480 --> 16:30.410
Extraordinary!

16:30.480 --> 16:31.410
Yeah!

16:32.790 --> 16:33.750
A little beauty!

16:35.060 --> 16:36.900
She's indeed worth this price!

16:40.230 --> 16:41.680
What are they doing?

16:42.660 --> 16:44.380
Don't you know, My Lady?

16:44.870 --> 16:46.770
This is a dancer captured at the border.

16:46.770 --> 16:48.940
It was prevalent in the capital
a few years ago.

16:48.940 --> 16:51.340
But since the Qianyu Army
lost that battle,

16:51.360 --> 16:52.600
the border market has been closed.

16:52.600 --> 16:54.360
Such goods are rare now.

16:54.390 --> 16:55.120
Goods...

16:55.790 --> 16:56.630
Goods?

16:57.860 --> 16:59.610
How can people be goods?

17:01.440 --> 17:02.730
150 taels of gold!

17:02.960 --> 17:03.960
200 taels of gold!

17:04.160 --> 17:05.069
500 taels of gold!

17:05.069 --> 17:06.960
I offer 1,000 taels of gold!

17:08.640 --> 17:09.730
I

17:10.000 --> 17:11.569
am Weichi Yan.

17:12.670 --> 17:13.990
I'm really rich.

17:15.670 --> 17:17.160
This girl might not

17:17.160 --> 17:19.220
be worth much in the past.

17:19.480 --> 17:20.960
But what's the situation now?

17:20.960 --> 17:24.910
His Majesty has kept
the Qianyu Army in the capital.

17:24.940 --> 17:26.480
The trade has been cut off!

17:27.030 --> 17:29.110
Rare stuff's worth big bucks!

17:29.110 --> 17:31.240
1,000 taels of gold! Totally worth it!

17:31.480 --> 17:32.960
1,000 is too high.

17:32.960 --> 17:34.640
It's even enough to buy 100 maids.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.270
Yes, too high.

17:36.270 --> 17:37.160
Yes.

17:37.240 --> 17:38.350
It's not worth it.

17:41.510 --> 17:42.710
Jealous, huh?

17:44.200 --> 17:46.710
This is the power of money.

17:48.160 --> 17:49.400
Look at her pretty face!

17:49.400 --> 17:50.550
The waist!

17:50.550 --> 17:51.750
And the body!

17:53.620 --> 17:55.180
This jerk.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.600
Come on.

17:56.620 --> 17:57.730
Here. Drink it.

17:58.780 --> 18:00.170
Drink it!

18:03.830 --> 18:04.750
Get lost!

18:04.750 --> 18:05.200
What?

18:05.200 --> 18:06.270
You bastard!

18:16.080 --> 18:17.120
What a wretch.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.580
Come on. Get up.

18:21.720 --> 18:23.270
If someone forces you to drink again,

18:23.270 --> 18:24.400
just hit him like this.

18:24.400 --> 18:25.160
Got it?

18:26.240 --> 18:27.570
It's okay. Don't worry.

18:27.590 --> 18:28.590
I'm the heroine.

18:28.590 --> 18:30.640
I have no say in the real world.

18:30.680 --> 18:32.980
But the world of this script is my oyster.

18:33.230 --> 18:35.960
Beat the heroine up!

18:36.160 --> 18:37.450
Oh, God. Seriously?

18:37.470 --> 18:39.270
Yingqiu, let's split up and run!

18:39.830 --> 18:40.940
Follow me.

18:41.400 --> 18:42.210
Help me.

18:42.240 --> 18:42.770
Yes, sir.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.000
Let's run.

18:45.000 --> 18:45.720
Stop!

18:46.310 --> 18:47.430
Stop there!

18:48.790 --> 18:49.680
Come on.

18:49.680 --> 18:50.550
Go after them!

18:50.640 --> 18:51.440
They're over there!

18:51.440 --> 18:52.070
This way.

18:52.070 --> 18:53.310
Hurry up.

18:53.350 --> 18:54.270
Excuse me.

18:54.270 --> 18:55.000
Sorry.

18:55.480 --> 18:56.110
Excuse me.

18:56.110 --> 18:57.200
-Stop!
-Make way!

18:58.820 --> 18:59.970
Stop there!

19:43.030 --> 19:43.830
General.

19:48.590 --> 19:50.110
He's here not to kill anyone

19:50.110 --> 19:51.720
but to test weapons, I think.

19:51.760 --> 19:52.720
Tell our men

19:52.720 --> 19:53.380
to retreat.

20:04.680 --> 20:05.740
Alright, safe now.

20:06.680 --> 20:08.610
Don't worry. They didn't catch up.

20:10.420 --> 20:11.980
No need to thank me.

20:12.290 --> 20:13.370
We're both

20:13.510 --> 20:15.760
victims of the scriptwriter,

20:15.780 --> 20:18.690
suffering from bad luck.

20:19.510 --> 20:20.620
It's okay.

20:31.650 --> 20:32.900
Are you okay?

20:46.680 --> 20:47.480
Pay...

20:47.480 --> 20:49.540
Pay for the 1,000 taels of gold

20:49.560 --> 20:50.730
with your life!

20:51.450 --> 20:53.590
How dare he kill people

20:53.590 --> 20:55.250
in the Waning River Crescent?

20:55.480 --> 20:56.270
Do it!

20:56.920 --> 20:58.020
Kill Lady Song?

20:58.050 --> 20:59.150
Kill that plutocrat.

20:59.150 --> 21:00.350
What about Lady Song?

21:00.480 --> 21:01.270
You do it.

21:02.920 --> 21:03.510
Well, well,

21:03.510 --> 21:05.030
you're leaving it to me now?

21:05.030 --> 21:05.880
Why don't you go

21:05.880 --> 21:06.960
eliminate all of them?

21:06.960 --> 21:08.680
So they won't cause us any more trouble.

21:08.680 --> 21:09.480
Okay.

21:10.440 --> 21:11.440
Didn't the Chief tell us

21:11.440 --> 21:13.170
not to kill irrelevant people?

21:14.680 --> 21:15.490
Kill her!

21:42.310 --> 21:43.640
W-Why is the Chief here?

21:43.880 --> 21:45.080
The plan has changed.

21:45.110 --> 21:46.350
Who are you?

21:49.920 --> 21:50.720
Excuse me.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.130
I'm just passing by.

21:53.790 --> 21:54.590
You guys go on.

22:00.300 --> 22:01.170
Kill her again!

22:02.650 --> 22:03.830
Help!

22:10.860 --> 22:12.030
Shangguan,

22:12.270 --> 22:13.670
what does the Chief mean?

22:13.830 --> 22:14.830
-He...
-Something's off.

22:14.830 --> 22:16.290
We'll talk about it later.

22:24.440 --> 22:27.970
What on earth do you mean, sir?

22:28.070 --> 22:28.880
15 minutes.

22:29.790 --> 22:32.550
Do it after 15 minutes when I'm far away.

22:32.580 --> 22:33.580
Understand?

22:43.310 --> 22:45.310
Is he playing the role
of a martial arts master?

22:45.310 --> 22:46.270
Crazy man.

22:48.270 --> 22:49.730
Kill her again!

23:01.550 --> 23:03.110
Didn't you hear me?

23:05.510 --> 23:07.020
Next time you kill someone,

23:07.020 --> 23:08.820
remember to find a remote place.

23:29.200 --> 23:31.350
Didn't I tell you not to make a scene?

23:31.510 --> 23:32.960
I didn't.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.350
It was you who came out of nowhere

23:34.350 --> 23:36.160
and knocked him off.

23:36.160 --> 23:37.510
What about the auction for that girl?

23:37.510 --> 23:38.510
They even killed her.

23:38.510 --> 23:39.640
No, she didn't die.

23:39.640 --> 23:41.160
We saved that dancer.

23:41.480 --> 23:42.510
The auction for the girl

23:42.510 --> 23:44.400
was a shady trade
made by the guest from outside.

23:44.400 --> 23:46.460
None of our people knew it in advance.

23:46.640 --> 23:48.200
We will make the pay for the audacity

23:48.200 --> 23:50.660
to sell people
in the Waning River Crescent.

23:50.720 --> 23:51.510
Chief!

23:52.880 --> 23:53.680
Chief!

23:54.960 --> 23:56.920
What should we do with those plutocrats?

23:56.920 --> 23:57.930
Sir!

24:00.160 --> 24:00.960
Sir!

24:02.030 --> 24:03.750
Where are you, sir?

24:05.270 --> 24:06.070
Sir...

24:07.380 --> 24:08.450
Sir!

24:14.950 --> 24:15.880
Stop running!

24:15.910 --> 24:16.890
I...

24:16.910 --> 24:18.410
I finally caught up with you.

24:18.410 --> 24:19.550
Were it not for you,

24:19.570 --> 24:21.450
the dancer and I would have died.

24:22.160 --> 24:22.960
Sir,

24:23.310 --> 24:24.960
w-what's your name?

24:25.210 --> 24:26.300
Where do you live?

24:26.320 --> 24:27.470
Tell me everything.

24:27.550 --> 24:28.440
I must repay you

24:28.440 --> 24:29.750
for saving my life.

24:29.880 --> 24:31.440
It's nothing.

24:31.680 --> 24:32.950
Don't mention it.

24:33.000 --> 24:33.790
Goodbye.

24:34.920 --> 24:36.300
No way.

24:36.400 --> 24:37.690
I need to know

24:37.720 --> 24:39.200
who my savior is!

24:39.480 --> 24:41.440
What a vicious beauty!

24:41.790 --> 24:43.840
How dare she mess around with our chief?

24:43.840 --> 24:45.300
How indecent!

24:46.750 --> 24:47.550
Do it.

24:48.720 --> 24:50.310
Heartbreak Needle.

24:50.400 --> 24:52.300
One needle to end her life.

24:52.610 --> 24:53.640
Get lost!

24:56.200 --> 24:57.400
Sir.

24:57.830 --> 24:58.830
What does he mean?

24:59.960 --> 25:01.160
I-I got it!

25:01.270 --> 25:02.200
The Chief means that

25:02.200 --> 25:03.510
the weapon we use is too small

25:03.510 --> 25:04.940
to kill her in one shot.

25:09.400 --> 25:10.460
How about this one?

25:11.680 --> 25:13.110
Tear-shedding Darts.

25:13.110 --> 25:14.590
Make them cry for pain.

25:15.480 --> 25:16.270
Come on.

25:17.110 --> 25:17.920
Do it.

25:17.920 --> 25:18.640
Sir!

25:19.400 --> 25:20.350
Are you injured?

25:22.440 --> 25:23.410
No.

25:23.450 --> 25:24.510
Don't lie to me!

25:24.510 --> 25:25.790
You're bleeding.

25:26.030 --> 25:27.680
You definitely got hurt
when you tried to save us.

25:27.680 --> 25:28.880
I said no.

25:29.070 --> 25:29.880
It's okay.

25:30.440 --> 25:31.070
Sir, you...

25:31.070 --> 25:32.400
You are good in every way

25:32.400 --> 25:33.770
but a bit stubborn.

25:33.800 --> 25:35.520
You didn't just stand by
and see them kill us.

25:35.520 --> 25:36.680
I can't leave you alone like this,

25:36.680 --> 25:36.920
right?

25:36.920 --> 25:38.240
Just let me take a look at your wound.

25:38.240 --> 25:39.110
Let me see if you're okay.

25:39.110 --> 25:39.750
It's late at night.

25:39.750 --> 25:40.680
There are only you and me.

25:40.680 --> 25:41.830
We'd better keep a distance.

25:41.830 --> 25:43.350
Keep a distance? No!

25:43.350 --> 25:44.200
My first priority now

25:44.200 --> 25:45.270
is to take you to the clinic

25:45.270 --> 25:46.110
and see if you're alright.

25:46.110 --> 25:46.680
Seriously.

25:46.680 --> 25:47.400
Let's go.

25:47.790 --> 25:48.590
Do it.

25:56.030 --> 25:56.990
What's wrong?

26:00.750 --> 26:01.960
Just stretch a bit.

26:02.880 --> 26:03.600
Well...

26:05.410 --> 26:07.780
Now? Here?

26:10.050 --> 26:12.190
A man should train day and night.

26:12.270 --> 26:13.300
Besides, a master

26:13.920 --> 26:16.500
usually practices martial arts at night.

26:19.720 --> 26:20.590
Chief,

26:21.680 --> 26:23.830
what secret are you hiding?

26:33.030 --> 26:34.510
What is it this time?

26:35.960 --> 26:38.010
Keep stretching.

26:39.290 --> 26:40.490
This just never ends.

26:44.030 --> 26:45.030
As expected,

26:45.200 --> 26:46.740
you can't kill her.

26:49.680 --> 26:50.480
Sir,

26:51.480 --> 26:52.400
what

26:52.440 --> 26:53.400
are we...

27:01.940 --> 27:03.040
Don't get me wrong.

27:03.510 --> 27:04.720
I'm not into you.

27:06.880 --> 27:08.350
I didn't say anything.

27:10.480 --> 27:12.010
Why are you two here?

27:12.920 --> 27:14.480
Did I disturb you?

27:22.200 --> 27:23.000
Chief?

27:24.030 --> 27:25.290
The person who saved me

27:25.290 --> 27:26.480
is your chief?

27:26.590 --> 27:27.740
Yes.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.770
That means

27:32.720 --> 27:34.200
he owns the entire

27:34.680 --> 27:35.790
Waning River Crescent?

27:35.790 --> 27:36.880
Of course.

27:37.070 --> 27:37.830
Who else is

27:37.830 --> 27:39.630
this capable besides our chief?

27:40.590 --> 27:41.620
Oh, my goodness.

27:41.750 --> 27:44.350
I just got to know
a really influential person!

27:44.870 --> 27:45.750
Sirs,

27:45.750 --> 27:46.200
come here.

27:46.200 --> 27:46.830
Come over, please.

27:46.830 --> 27:48.310
I have a few questions to ask about

27:48.310 --> 27:48.720
your chief.

27:48.720 --> 27:49.240
Do it.

27:50.350 --> 27:51.880
Calm down, Yunlong.

27:51.880 --> 27:52.440
The Chief told us

27:52.440 --> 27:53.900
not to act rashly again.

27:54.030 --> 27:56.510
I just want to ask a few questions.

27:56.510 --> 27:58.090
Do you need a meeting for that?

27:58.090 --> 27:58.760
Miss,

27:58.790 --> 28:00.350
just a minute.

28:01.240 --> 28:03.140
Dude, are you crazy?

28:03.200 --> 28:05.100
How dare you try to kill
the Chief's woman?

28:05.100 --> 28:07.060
Lust can get one killed.

28:07.270 --> 28:08.920
Get killed?

28:10.130 --> 28:11.830
Miss, well...

28:11.830 --> 28:14.310
He said you were cute.

28:14.400 --> 28:15.830
Cute?

28:15.830 --> 28:17.030
He's from the south.

28:17.050 --> 28:18.040
He has an accent.

28:18.270 --> 28:19.570
From the south?

28:19.920 --> 28:21.380
What accent?

28:21.440 --> 28:22.240
Do it.

28:22.660 --> 28:23.640
Yunlong! Yunlong!

28:23.640 --> 28:24.590
"Do it?" Is it the only thing

28:24.590 --> 28:25.270
in your mind?

28:25.270 --> 28:26.830
"Do it?"

28:26.920 --> 28:28.800
Who are you going to fight?

28:28.960 --> 28:29.750
Not fighting!

28:29.750 --> 28:31.110
H-He said...

28:31.350 --> 28:32.240
Chief Lady!

28:33.670 --> 28:34.910
Right, guys?

28:35.830 --> 28:36.440
Yes.

28:36.440 --> 28:38.960
Chief Lady! Chief Lady!

28:39.330 --> 28:40.590
You call me Chief Lady?

28:41.050 --> 28:42.380
I'm not your Chief Lady.

28:43.640 --> 28:44.160
I'm not.

28:44.160 --> 28:44.880
Do it!

28:45.510 --> 28:46.570
Yunlong! Yunlong!

28:47.200 --> 28:48.460
Why is he dragged away?

28:50.310 --> 28:51.710
Is your brother

28:52.400 --> 28:53.510
a bit

28:53.680 --> 28:55.210
out of his mind?

28:55.240 --> 28:56.030
Yes.

28:56.150 --> 28:57.000
Leave him alone.

28:57.000 --> 28:58.530
Let's get down to business.

28:59.000 --> 28:59.790
Business?

29:00.270 --> 29:01.130
What business?

29:07.240 --> 29:08.420
What is this?

29:09.350 --> 29:10.750
Customer registration.

29:11.220 --> 29:12.620
Customer registration?

29:13.200 --> 29:13.960
Name, residence,

29:13.960 --> 29:14.790
height, weight,

29:14.790 --> 29:15.750
hobbies, quirks,

29:15.750 --> 29:16.480
ideal partner.

29:16.480 --> 29:17.830
Can you accept a masked man?

29:17.830 --> 29:20.440
Can you accept an unsocial and boring man?

29:22.230 --> 29:23.760
I've got it done as you said.

29:23.960 --> 29:25.560
Keep every mouth shut.

29:25.680 --> 29:27.750
Those plutocrats won't know what happened

29:27.750 --> 29:29.280
when they wake up tomorrow.

29:31.550 --> 29:32.500
Why did you

29:32.960 --> 29:34.620
strike in the forest just now?

29:39.550 --> 29:41.750
Because I wanted to confirm something.

29:42.350 --> 29:43.160
What was it?

29:45.240 --> 29:47.170
You can't kill Song Yimeng, right?

29:50.500 --> 29:51.890
The Seventh Prince.

30:10.850 --> 30:12.310
What are you trying to say?

30:16.210 --> 30:17.480
I mean,

30:17.500 --> 30:19.110
I'm the only Nightwalker

30:19.140 --> 30:21.180
who knows your real identity.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.600
Given our deep friendship,

30:22.600 --> 30:24.230
why are you even hiding it from me?

30:24.230 --> 30:25.430
I'm heartbroken.

30:25.790 --> 30:27.850
Just do whatever I tell you to do.

30:27.880 --> 30:29.480
Don't ask about anything else.

30:29.480 --> 30:31.040
But I'm curious.

30:35.660 --> 30:36.830
At first,

30:36.920 --> 30:38.490
I just found it quite weird.

30:38.690 --> 30:40.690
You are the Seventh Prince.

30:40.720 --> 30:43.800
You could have
wiped out a weak woman easily.

30:43.910 --> 30:45.200
Why did you have to use

30:45.200 --> 30:47.620
your trump card, Nightwalkers?

30:48.750 --> 30:52.190
Or why did you have to do it yourself?

30:54.570 --> 30:56.090
There's only one answer.

30:57.810 --> 30:59.540
There must be some connection

30:59.560 --> 31:01.120
between you and her.

31:02.000 --> 31:03.500
When Song Yimeng's in danger,

31:03.500 --> 31:05.440
you must go save her.

31:06.290 --> 31:07.760
Just like when the plutocrat
tried to kill her

31:07.760 --> 31:10.130
and when Yunlong, Shanhu, and I
attempted to assassinate her.

31:10.130 --> 31:11.160
Am I

31:11.640 --> 31:12.310
right?

31:14.750 --> 31:16.840
I thought you'd only conclude it

31:16.950 --> 31:18.910
as some romantic stuff.

31:18.940 --> 31:20.360
I did think about it that way.

31:20.360 --> 31:21.790
But I know you well.

31:22.240 --> 31:23.790
Even if the ocean is upside down,

31:23.790 --> 31:25.030
and heaven and earth converge,

31:25.030 --> 31:26.450
you, the stubborn bachelor, will never

31:26.450 --> 31:29.300
fall for or court any woman,

31:29.550 --> 31:31.500
let alone give up your principle.

31:32.040 --> 31:32.840
You know what?

31:33.300 --> 31:34.350
I like smart people,

31:34.350 --> 31:36.480
but I don't like people
who are way too smart.

31:36.480 --> 31:37.310
Three years ago,

31:37.310 --> 31:39.310
I got you out of the celestial prison.

31:39.310 --> 31:40.310
Three years later,

31:40.310 --> 31:42.360
I can send you back as well.

31:42.480 --> 31:43.440
Fine, fine.

31:43.470 --> 31:44.600
I see.

31:44.620 --> 31:46.170
My wretched life is in your hands,

31:46.170 --> 31:46.930
alright?

31:47.480 --> 31:49.080
What about Song Yimeng then?

31:49.100 --> 31:51.550
How should we deal with her after tonight?

31:56.130 --> 31:57.160
See?

31:57.160 --> 31:59.660
You've been searching for
the method of weapon forging for years,

31:59.660 --> 32:00.720
yet making no progress.

32:00.720 --> 32:02.930
Now the chance is right in front of you.

32:02.960 --> 32:04.700
You never thought about using Song Yimeng

32:04.700 --> 32:06.340
to steal it from Chu Guihong?

32:07.750 --> 32:09.440
If you could come up with it,

32:09.440 --> 32:11.100
don't you think I already did?

32:11.400 --> 32:13.480
Song Yimeng is afraid of me.

32:13.980 --> 32:16.150
But she is cunning

32:16.170 --> 32:17.370
and can't be trusted.

32:18.350 --> 32:19.810
A person who can't work for me

32:19.810 --> 32:21.540
and knows too many of my secrets

32:22.130 --> 32:24.790
will be a threat if I keep her alive.

32:25.310 --> 32:26.110
You're wrong.

32:27.820 --> 32:29.330
Song Yimeng is afraid of

32:28.280 --> 32:32.630
[Grace & Elegance]

32:29.440 --> 32:32.350
that stern and aloof Seventh Prince,
Nan Heng.

32:33.030 --> 32:34.550
But your current identity

32:34.570 --> 32:36.230
is Li Shiliu, the chivalrous swordsman

32:36.230 --> 32:38.760
who saved her from danger.

32:39.010 --> 32:41.290
Since she's so mysterious

32:41.310 --> 32:42.820
and on good terms with Chu Guihong,

32:42.820 --> 32:44.190
and she may also know how Chu Guihong

32:44.190 --> 32:47.200
and the Eighteenth Prince
plan to fight for the throne,

32:47.200 --> 32:50.320
you might as well
get close to her as her savior

32:50.340 --> 32:51.870
to investigate everything

32:51.890 --> 32:53.340
and move step by step.

32:53.370 --> 32:54.490
Isn't it good?

33:04.410 --> 33:05.540
Look.

33:05.830 --> 33:07.550
The traditional information recording

33:07.550 --> 33:09.550
lacks categorization and summary.

33:09.570 --> 33:12.120
It leads to low efficiency

33:12.140 --> 33:14.200
and difficulty in pinpointing data.

33:15.070 --> 33:16.420
It's different now.

33:16.500 --> 33:18.310
Categorizing the data

33:16.620 --> 33:21.080
[Name, Age, Family]

33:18.330 --> 33:19.480
not only makes it so clear

33:19.480 --> 33:21.750
but also archives everything

33:21.780 --> 33:23.090
in an efficient way.

33:23.350 --> 33:25.350
It's indeed so clear now!

33:26.550 --> 33:28.240
A lady from an official family

33:28.240 --> 33:29.440
is really something!

33:30.130 --> 33:31.090
It's nothing.

33:31.160 --> 33:33.700
Just a necessary skill in the workplace.

33:34.240 --> 33:35.000
From now on,

33:35.000 --> 33:36.030
you can use it to evaluate

33:36.030 --> 33:37.890
each visitor's overall profile.

33:38.600 --> 33:40.200
There are no other visitors.

33:40.590 --> 33:43.720
You're the only one who can make our chief
give up his principle.

33:43.720 --> 33:44.590
Me?

33:46.000 --> 33:48.640
But I just met your chief.

33:48.660 --> 33:50.870
I don't even know his name.

33:51.030 --> 33:51.830
Exactly.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.030
This

33:53.050 --> 33:55.250
is one of our chief's biggest problems.

33:55.260 --> 33:57.640
He loves doing good deeds
but never tells anyone his name.

33:57.640 --> 33:58.440
Of course,

33:58.590 --> 34:00.450
he has many other problems.

34:01.730 --> 34:02.820
For example?

34:02.840 --> 34:04.500
The Chief doesn't like women!

34:06.250 --> 34:07.750
Don't listen to his gibberish.

34:07.750 --> 34:09.300
There's no way
the Chief doesn't like women!

34:09.300 --> 34:10.489
He's swamped with

34:10.510 --> 34:11.659
the gang's affairs every day,

34:11.659 --> 34:13.860
so he doesn't have time
to find himself a wife!

34:13.860 --> 34:14.940
I'm begging you.

34:14.969 --> 34:16.380
Stop messing around.

34:17.409 --> 34:19.290
Thanks to our chief's dedication,

34:19.290 --> 34:20.770
we can eat well

34:20.790 --> 34:21.540
dress well,

34:21.570 --> 34:22.880
and don't have to sleep rough

34:22.880 --> 34:24.020
or struggle for our lives.

34:24.020 --> 34:25.889
He's the one and only Chief Master
who means so much

34:25.889 --> 34:27.210
to each one of us.

34:27.239 --> 34:28.280
That is Li Shiliu!

34:29.850 --> 34:31.409
Pear pomegranate?
(Sounds the same in Chinese.)

34:31.409 --> 34:34.290
There's such an outstanding character
in the script?

34:34.290 --> 34:35.949
Why didn't I notice it before?

34:36.210 --> 34:37.050
The client

34:37.360 --> 34:38.400
asked the Chief

34:38.770 --> 34:39.730
to kill you.

34:41.570 --> 34:43.489
The client asked the Chief to kill

34:45.120 --> 34:45.909
me...

34:50.230 --> 34:51.330
So,

34:52.080 --> 34:54.179
you brought me here on purpose.

34:54.630 --> 34:56.480
It was a trap set by Nan Heng?

34:58.150 --> 34:59.110
Miss Song,

34:59.140 --> 35:00.230
our chief did receive

35:00.230 --> 35:01.690
the Seventh Prince's commission
to kill you.

35:01.690 --> 35:03.890
But he is really
deeply in love with you.

35:03.920 --> 35:04.650
Otherwise, he

35:04.650 --> 35:07.050
wouldn't have stopped us from killing you.

35:07.670 --> 35:08.480
So,

35:09.670 --> 35:11.750
you all want to kill me?

35:14.610 --> 35:15.440
No.

35:15.470 --> 35:16.150
Help!

35:16.170 --> 35:16.860
Stop!

35:18.030 --> 35:18.590
Help!

35:18.590 --> 35:18.960
Miss! Miss!

35:18.960 --> 35:19.920
Let me explain.

35:19.960 --> 35:20.760
Don't get us wrong.

35:20.760 --> 35:21.860
This is a misunderstanding.

35:21.860 --> 35:23.130
Stop explaining.

35:23.160 --> 35:24.090
What's the fuss?

35:27.190 --> 35:28.080
Chief Master.

35:36.710 --> 35:37.830
Did they bully you?

35:38.590 --> 35:40.160
No, we didn't.

35:40.190 --> 35:41.240
No, Chief.

35:41.340 --> 35:43.610
We get along well with Miss Song.

35:43.640 --> 35:44.880
Right, Miss Song?

35:49.330 --> 35:50.140
Miss Song,

35:50.700 --> 35:51.700
they are just some

35:51.700 --> 35:53.400
vulgar folks of the martial world.

35:53.400 --> 35:54.600
I hope you don't mind.

35:55.630 --> 35:56.440
However,

35:57.400 --> 35:59.590
we don't intend to participate
in the court fights.

35:59.590 --> 36:01.220
So, Miss Song, please don't tell anyone

36:01.220 --> 36:03.880
about tonight's incident
when you return home.

36:07.370 --> 36:08.400
You mean

36:08.850 --> 36:10.360
you will let me go?

36:10.530 --> 36:11.530
Sir, don't worry.

36:11.560 --> 36:12.790
You saved my life.

36:12.810 --> 36:14.280
I won't cause you any trouble.

36:14.280 --> 36:15.080
Rest assured.

36:15.810 --> 36:16.830
Thank you then.

36:17.930 --> 36:18.810
Yunlong, Shanhu.

36:18.810 --> 36:19.520
Yes, Chief.

36:19.840 --> 36:21.090
Escort Miss Song back.

36:21.090 --> 36:22.140
No.

36:25.250 --> 36:27.210
We have some guests from the army tonight.

36:27.210 --> 36:28.750
Yunlong and Shanhu will go with me
to wrap it up.

36:28.750 --> 36:29.760
They're not available.

36:29.760 --> 36:30.700
What about Huang and Li?

36:30.700 --> 36:31.850
There's a shop in debt.

36:31.850 --> 36:33.030
They have to do the dirty work.

36:33.030 --> 36:33.860
What about Luo?

36:33.860 --> 36:36.110
He's rushing home.
His wife is about to give birth.

36:36.110 --> 36:37.280
No one is available

36:37.280 --> 36:39.480
throughout our Waning River Crescent?

36:39.870 --> 36:41.940
You're available, Chief.

36:41.960 --> 36:43.170
The beauty's way back

36:43.200 --> 36:44.470
is treacherous.

36:44.490 --> 36:46.150
It has to be you escorting her.

36:47.050 --> 36:49.260
Maybe I should go home by myself.

36:49.290 --> 36:50.460
No way.

36:50.480 --> 36:53.530
We Nightwalkers are known for chivalry.

36:53.630 --> 36:56.000
How can we let a weak woman like you

36:56.000 --> 36:57.600
leave on your own?

36:57.750 --> 36:58.830
Am I right,

36:58.850 --> 37:00.080
Chief?

37:02.480 --> 37:03.150
Please.

37:27.300 --> 37:30.440
You might as well
get close to her as her savior

37:30.710 --> 37:32.340
to investigate everything

37:32.370 --> 37:33.830
and move step by step.

37:33.940 --> 37:34.750
Isn't it good?

37:36.360 --> 37:37.440
Our chief did receive

37:37.440 --> 37:39.020
the Seventh Prince's commission
to kill you.

37:39.020 --> 37:41.270
But he is really
deeply in love with you.

37:41.300 --> 37:42.030
Otherwise, he

37:42.030 --> 37:44.430
wouldn't have stopped us from killing you.

37:56.190 --> 37:57.390
-Well...
-Miss Song.

37:58.710 --> 37:59.800
You go first.

38:00.250 --> 38:01.040
You go first.

38:02.670 --> 38:03.800
Okay, I'll go first.

38:05.230 --> 38:07.430
Yunlong and Shanhu told me everything.

38:08.900 --> 38:10.150
What did they say?

38:10.670 --> 38:11.480
They said...

38:12.960 --> 38:13.890
They said you

38:14.030 --> 38:15.830
received the mission to kill me.

38:17.140 --> 38:19.410
But you definitely had no choice.

38:19.550 --> 38:20.600
Right, sir?

38:22.740 --> 38:23.770
Yeah.

38:23.800 --> 38:24.750
Of course

38:25.230 --> 38:26.420
I was forced to do so.

38:26.970 --> 38:28.130
Those idiots.

38:28.160 --> 38:28.890
Well,

38:28.910 --> 38:30.930
you saved me in the end.

38:31.480 --> 38:32.280
Sir,

38:32.360 --> 38:34.960
although we haven't known
each other for long,

38:34.960 --> 38:36.190
I can tell that

38:36.210 --> 38:38.730
you, Yunlong, and Shanhu are not bad guys.

38:38.760 --> 38:40.090
You're all nice people.

38:41.090 --> 38:42.930
You ended up working

38:42.960 --> 38:44.580
as assassins for others

38:44.780 --> 38:46.420
in the martial world

38:46.670 --> 38:48.340
for some unknown reasons,

38:48.370 --> 38:49.390
right?

38:51.130 --> 38:52.990
What do you want to say, Miss Song?

38:56.280 --> 38:57.230
I mean...

38:58.230 --> 38:59.030
Sir,

38:59.110 --> 39:01.230
although you let me go today,

39:01.510 --> 39:03.630
based on what I know about Nan Heng,

39:03.650 --> 39:05.450
he won't let you go for sure.

39:06.210 --> 39:07.640
What's worse,

39:07.850 --> 39:10.420
he will also go after
your treasured Waning River Crescent

39:10.420 --> 39:11.780
as well as your men.

39:12.070 --> 39:12.880
So,

39:13.320 --> 39:14.540
I have a suggestion.

39:14.630 --> 39:16.770
I hope our kind "villagers"

39:16.800 --> 39:18.720
share the same goal

39:18.740 --> 39:20.050
and join hands

39:20.110 --> 39:22.740
to fight that cruel "werewolf."

39:22.850 --> 39:24.070
Okay?

39:24.550 --> 39:25.440
"Werewolf"?

39:25.440 --> 39:26.490
"Villagers"?

39:26.510 --> 39:28.130
Well, you mean

39:28.150 --> 39:29.950
you want me to join hands with you

39:30.370 --> 39:32.430
to fight that high and mighty prince?

39:34.110 --> 39:35.440
Yes, that's what I mean.

39:35.770 --> 39:37.420
It's also for the sake

39:37.440 --> 39:38.890
of your safety.

39:41.920 --> 39:43.630
Why do you think

39:44.150 --> 39:45.960
Nan Heng won't let me go?

39:46.030 --> 39:47.710
Because he is a bad guy!

39:47.980 --> 39:49.220
Bad guy, you know?

39:49.640 --> 39:51.500
He kills without blinking an eye.

39:51.710 --> 39:53.920
Sir, during all these years
in the martial world,

39:53.920 --> 39:55.590
you must have also heard of that.

39:55.590 --> 39:57.550
He's just ambitious,

39:57.570 --> 39:58.530
ruthless,

39:58.560 --> 40:00.080
heartless,

40:00.110 --> 40:01.030
doing all evil deeds,

40:01.030 --> 40:01.920
framing loyal officials,

40:01.920 --> 40:02.980
and hurting women.

40:03.080 --> 40:04.440
Weren't it not for the script rule...

40:04.440 --> 40:06.180
That's ridiculous.

40:06.760 --> 40:07.550
Right?

40:07.840 --> 40:09.830
You also think he's ridiculous, huh?

40:09.830 --> 40:11.230
I just don't get it.

40:11.260 --> 40:12.620
Why can someone like him

40:12.650 --> 40:14.330
keep staying in that high position

40:14.330 --> 40:15.190
and doing evil?

40:15.190 --> 40:16.470
There's no justice!

40:19.070 --> 40:19.550
Fine.

40:21.510 --> 40:23.480
If Nan Heng were really

40:23.480 --> 40:24.900
as evil as you said,

40:24.930 --> 40:26.190
then tell me—

40:26.220 --> 40:28.010
during the Jinyang Mutiny four years ago

40:28.010 --> 40:29.710
when the Qianyu Army
stepped aside and did nothing,

40:29.710 --> 40:30.590
why would he lead

40:30.590 --> 40:32.630
the Xuanjia Army to fight
for seven days to quell the unrest?

40:32.630 --> 40:34.120
Just for show?

40:35.810 --> 40:37.350
Of course!

40:38.920 --> 40:40.540
You never thought about

40:40.560 --> 40:41.790
why he did this?

40:41.810 --> 40:42.650
Why?

40:43.110 --> 40:45.630
Because he coveted Jinyang's mine.

40:45.630 --> 40:47.370
He misappropriated the government's funds

40:47.370 --> 40:49.500
in the name of suppressing the unrest.

40:52.000 --> 40:52.800
Fine.

40:53.630 --> 40:54.660
How about this?

40:55.060 --> 40:56.840
In the Battle of Tancheng five years ago,

40:56.840 --> 40:58.480
the Xuanjia Army was trapped
in Yangu Pass.

40:58.480 --> 40:59.800
Chu Guihong was supposed to back them up,

40:59.800 --> 41:01.220
yet he didn't do anything.

41:01.220 --> 41:03.400
It was Nan Heng
who led 2,000 Xuanjia soldiers

41:03.400 --> 41:06.100
to fight a fierce battle for 49 days
and successfully defend the pass.

41:06.100 --> 41:07.960
What do you have to say about that?

41:08.080 --> 41:09.050
Sir,

41:09.080 --> 41:11.390
it was all because Nan Heng
underestimated the enemy,

41:11.390 --> 41:12.880
acted recklessly,
and fell into their trap.

41:12.880 --> 41:14.940
Otherwise, things wouldn't
have gotten that worse.

41:14.940 --> 41:16.900
Don't blame it on anyone else.

41:17.840 --> 41:18.470
Fine.

41:19.590 --> 41:20.990
Let's forget about them.

41:21.470 --> 41:22.400
Ten years ago,

41:22.400 --> 41:24.030
in the nationwide war against Dongshuo,

41:24.030 --> 41:25.710
5,000 Xuanjia soldiers

41:25.710 --> 41:27.630
confronted 40,000 elite Dongshuo soldiers.

41:27.630 --> 41:29.440
Were it not for Nan Heng who charged

41:29.440 --> 41:31.580
and beheaded the enemy general,

41:31.600 --> 41:33.880
how could they have reversed
the three months of consecutive defeats

41:33.880 --> 41:36.340
and brought ten years
of peace to the border?

41:37.150 --> 41:37.960
What's wrong?

41:37.960 --> 41:38.940
Sir, do you hear that?

41:38.940 --> 41:39.700
Hear what?

41:39.730 --> 41:41.810
How reckless Nan Heng was!

41:41.840 --> 41:43.280
5,000 against 40,000.

41:43.280 --> 41:44.480
Was he out of his mind?

41:44.480 --> 41:46.550
He didn't coordinate
and give orders at the back.

41:46.550 --> 41:48.000
As a general, he charged at the front

41:48.000 --> 41:49.190
to steal the show!

41:49.190 --> 41:50.550
You know what, Mr. Li?

41:50.570 --> 41:51.960
Nan Heng is...

41:52.070 --> 41:53.360
He...

41:54.150 --> 41:56.400
He might be somewhat insane.
